{"comments":"13/03/2026: The API has been updated to include the companySlug field in the response.","updatedAt":1785649720,"offset":0,"limit":20,"totalCount":94815,"jobs":[{"title":"German Audio Recording Expert","excerpt":"Role Title: German Audio Recording Expert Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging German Audio Recording Experts to participate in a project supporting a major customer.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["German-Voice-Over","German-Voice-Actor"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p>Role Title: German Audio Recording Expert</p><p></p><p>Role Type: Contractor</p><p></p><p>Location: Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging German Audio Recording Experts to participate in a project supporting a major customer. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters. We are seeking native German speakers with a robust background in professional audio recording to capture precise, studio-quality voice samples that reflect authentic conversational and narration styles. As a vital contributor, you'll ensure each submission meets strict technical and linguistic standards, helping to build diverse and reliable datasets for advanced machine learning applications.</p><p></p><p>Scope of Work</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Produce and submit high-quality German audio recordings using professional-grade equipment</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Follow predefined scripts or prompts to generate accurate and natural-sounding speech samples</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ensure all recordings meet specified technical and linguistic criteria, including clarity, pronunciation, and consistency</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Participate in a sample review process by submitting a representative voice recording as part of the engagement</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Collaborate with the project team to resolve queries and adjust recordings based on constructive feedback</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Document recording setup, processes, and any issues encountered to maintain data integrity</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Deliver recordings following project timelines and quality benchmarks</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Preferred Qualifications</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Native fluency in German, with exceptional pronunciation and diction</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Minimum three years of professional audio recording experience</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Proficiency with advanced audio recording hardware and software</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Strong command of both written and verbal communication for collaboration and documentation</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Attention to detail in audio quality control, including noise reduction and sound accuracy</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Experience in voice narration, dubbing, or related performance work is a plus</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ability to interpret and accurately deliver a variety of scripts or prompts</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Please note that you will need your professional audio equipment during the interview.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785649720,"expiryDate":1788241696,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/german-audio-recording-expert","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/german-audio-recording-expert"},{"title":"Engineering & Data tools Specialist","excerpt":"Role Title: Engineering & Data tools Specialist Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Engineering & Data tools Specialists to contribute expertise to a dynamic customer project focused on engineering and data tooling.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Data-Engineering-Specialist","Engineering-Data-Specialist","Data-Tools-Developer","Developer-Tooling-Engineer"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p>Role Title: Engineering &amp; Data tools Specialist</p><p></p><p>Role Type: Contractor</p><p></p><p>Location: Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Engineering &amp; Data tools Specialists to contribute expertise to a dynamic customer project focused on engineering and data tooling. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters. This is an opportunity to work with a diverse tech stack, leverage your cloud and infrastructure knowledge, and provide valuable feedback on industry-leading tools across both engineering and data domains.</p><p></p><p>Scope of Work</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Evaluate and provide insights on the usability and effectiveness of engineering and data tools such as GitHub, Azure, Metabase, and JIRA.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Create comprehensive documentation and feedback reports based on real-world tool usage and best practices in engineering environments.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Design, review, and test workflows integrating cloud solutions (e.g., AWS, Azure, Firebase) and developer productivity platforms (e.g., Linear, Postman, n8n).</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Analyze data visualization, monitoring, and CI/CD tools—including Tableau, Datadog, Sentry, and BrowserStack—for integration potential and process improvements.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Contribute to the development of detailed use cases, technical guides, and process documentation for new features and data workflows.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Collaborate closely with project stakeholders via strong written and verbal communication, delivering actionable recommendations and technical insights.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Preferred Qualifications</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>3+ years direct, hands-on experience with engineering, developer tooling, and cloud infrastructure platforms.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Proficiency with a variety of tools, including GitHub, Postman, AWS, Firebase, Azure, Datadog, Sentry, JIRA, Linear, n8n, Twilio, Databricks, Tableau, Metabase, and BrowserStack.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with a strong focus on clarity and technical accuracy.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Bachelor’s degree in computer science, engineering, data science, or equivalent practical experience.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated ability to synthesize complex technical feedback into actionable improvement proposals.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Experience supporting both cloud/infrastructure and developer tooling domains is highly desirable.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Self-driven, detail-oriented, and comfortable working in an independent, remote contributor capacity.</p></li>\n</ol><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785649685,"expiryDate":1788241662,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/engineering-data-tools-specialist","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/engineering-data-tools-specialist"},{"title":"Italian Audio Recording Expert","excerpt":"Role Title: Italian Audio Recording Expert Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Italian Audio Recording Experts to contribute to a customer's project focused on large-scale audio data creation.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Audio-Recording-Specialist","Audio-Recording-Technician","Italian-Voice-Acting"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p>Role Title: Italian Audio Recording Expert</p><p></p><p>Role Type: Contractor</p><p></p><p>Location: Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Italian Audio Recording Experts to contribute to a customer's project focused on large-scale audio data creation. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Produce and deliver clear, high-fidelity audio recordings in native Italian, adhering to detailed project specifications.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Utilize professional-grade audio equipment to achieve optimal sound quality and minimize background noise.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Follow provided scripts or prompts accurately while maintaining natural speech and intonation.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Submit sample recordings as part of the project’s initial evaluation process using your best recording setup.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Collaborate with project managers and technical contacts via written and verbal communication to ensure deliverable quality and consistency.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Provide feedback on recording guidelines and suggest improvements based on your expertise.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ensure timely completion and secure transfer of audio files according to project protocols.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Native proficiency in Italian, with impeccable diction and pronunciation.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Minimum of three years’ experience in professional audio recording or voice work.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated expertise with industry-standard audio hardware and software.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Strong written and verbal communication skills, with attention to detail in documentation and correspondence.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ability to deliver polished samples using your own high-quality recording equipment.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Experience working with scripted audio projects, such as voiceover, narration, or dubbing.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Previous collaboration on media, tech, or linguistic data projects is a plus.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Please note that you will need your professional audio equipment during the interview.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785649574,"expiryDate":1788241552,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/italian-audio-recording-expert","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/italian-audio-recording-expert"},{"title":"Mandarin Audio Recording Expert","excerpt":"Role Title: Mandarin Audio Recording Expert Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Mandarin Audio Recording Experts to collaborate on a project for a customer focused on developing advanced AI models.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Audio-Recording-Specialist","Chinese-Language-Expert","Voice-Recording-Specialist","Mandarin-Chinese-Transcriber","Mandarin-Language-Services"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p>Role Title: Mandarin Audio Recording Expert</p><p></p><p>Role Type: Contractor</p><p></p><p>Location: Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Mandarin Audio Recording Experts to collaborate on a project for a customer focused on developing advanced AI models. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p></p><p>Scope of Work</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Create and deliver high-fidelity Mandarin audio recordings using professional-grade equipment according to project specifications.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Adhere to established guidelines for audio quality, clarity, and consistency throughout all submissions.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Assist in the preparation, setup, and optimization of recording environments to minimize background noise and enhance sound fidelity.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Provide a diverse range of vocal samples, tones, and pronunciations to ensure a robust dataset for AI training.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Review, edit, and submit finalized recordings that meet established technical and linguistic standards.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Communicate promptly and professionally with the project team, responding to feedback and incorporating revisions as needed.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Maintain organized records of all delivered files and associated documentation for project tracking.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Preferred Qualifications</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Native Mandarin speaker with clear and accurate pronunciation.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Minimum of three years of experience in professional audio recording (studio work, voice-over, narration, or similar domains).</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Proficiency in using advanced audio recording equipment and editing software.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated ability to deliver studio-quality recordings with minimal ambient interference.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Strong attention to detail in both vocal delivery and technical setup.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Excellent written and verbal communication skills, with a commitment to clear, professional exchanges.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Experience participating in projects involving AI data collection or linguistic resource creation is a plus.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Please note that you will need your professional audio equipment during the interview.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785649505,"expiryDate":1788241482,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/mandarin-audio-recording-expert","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/mandarin-audio-recording-expert"},{"title":"Portuguese Audio Recording Expert (Portugal)","excerpt":"Role Title: Portuguese Audio Recording Expert (Portugal) Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Portuguese Audio Recording Experts (Portugal) to contribute to a unique project for a valued customer.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":["Portugal"],"timezoneRestrictions":[-1,0],"categories":["Portuguese-Language-Expert","Portuguese-Language-Voice-Work","Voice-Recording-Specialist"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p>Role Title: Portuguese Audio Recording Expert (Portugal)</p><p></p><p>Role Type: Contractor</p><p></p><p>Location: Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Portuguese Audio Recording Experts (Portugal) to contribute to a unique project for a valued customer. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p></p><p>Scope of Work</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Produce top-quality Portuguese audio recordings in alignment with detailed project specifications.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Leverage professional-grade equipment to deliver clear, accurate, and natural-sounding speech samples.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Follow defined recording protocols, including file formatting, environment standards, and submission guidelines.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Submit an initial audio sample as part of the project onboarding process, demonstrating advanced technical proficiency.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Collaborate with the project team to ensure consistency, clarity, and authenticity in submitted recordings.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Provide feedback and expertise on optimizing the audio recording process to meet evolving project needs.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Maintain a high standard of linguistic authenticity, with particular attention to native pronunciation and regional nuances from Portugal Portuguese.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Preferred Qualifications</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Native fluency in European Portuguese, with demonstrable understanding of regional dialects and nuances.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Minimum of three years of hands-on experience in professional audio recording (studio, voice-over, broadcasting, or similar domains).</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Proficiency in using advanced audio recording equipment and editing software.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>A strong portfolio of relevant audio work, ideally including projects for commercial, broadcast, or academic purposes.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Meticulous attention to detail, with proven ability to deliver clear and high-fidelity speech recordings.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Strong organizational and communication skills, with commitment to timely and accurate deliverables.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ability to provide a high-quality audio sample using your own professional-grade equipment as part of the engagement process.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Please note that you will need your professional audio equipment during the interview.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785649476,"expiryDate":1788241445,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/portuguese-audio-recording-expert-portugal","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/portuguese-audio-recording-expert-portugal"},{"title":"Portuguese Audio Recording Expert (Brazil)","excerpt":"Role Title: Portuguese Audio Recording Expert (Brazil) Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Portuguese Audio Recording Experts (Brazil) to participate in a transformative project for a global customer.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":["Brazil"],"timezoneRestrictions":[-5,-4,-3,-2],"categories":["Portuguese-Language-Voice-Work","Brazilian-Portuguese-QC-Specialist","Brazilian-Portuguese-Specialist","Brazilian-Portuguese-AI-Specialist"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p>Role Title: Portuguese Audio Recording Expert (Brazil)</p><p></p><p>Role Type: Contractor</p><p></p><p>Location: Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Portuguese Audio Recording Experts (Brazil) to participate in a transformative project for a global customer. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p></p><p>Scope of Work</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Create and deliver high-fidelity Portuguese (Brazil) audio recordings using professional-grade equipment.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Interpret project guidelines to produce clear, natural, and contextually relevant audio samples for AI training.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Curate, review, and ensure the linguistic accuracy and quality of all recordings submitted.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Collaborate remotely with project coordinators and provide feedback or insights as needed during the recording process.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Follow specific technical and quality standards for file formatting, consistency, and clarity.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Supply a professional audio sample as part of the project's onboarding process, demonstrating your recording skill.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Meet agreed-upon project deliverables and timelines for audio submissions.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Preferred Qualifications</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Native-level fluency in Brazilian Portuguese, with a strong command of pronunciation and intonation.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Minimum of three years of proven experience in professional audio recording or voice work.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated proficiency with high-end recording equipment and industry-standard audio editing tools.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Excellent written and verbal communication skills in Portuguese; ability to follow nuanced project instructions.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Portfolio or track record of high-quality audio projects, ideally for media, broadcasting, or educational content.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Familiarity with quality assurance processes for audio deliverables.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ability to collaborate effectively in a remote, feedback-driven engagement environment.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Please note that you will need your professional audio equipment during the interview.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785649158,"expiryDate":1788241128,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/portuguese-audio-recording-expert-brazil","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/portuguese-audio-recording-expert-brazil"},{"title":"Dutch Audio Recording Experts","excerpt":"Role Title: Dutch Audio Recording Experts Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Dutch Audio Recording Experts to contribute their advanced skills to a dynamic customer project.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Audio-Recording-Specialist","Audio-Recording-Services"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p>Role Title: Dutch Audio Recording Experts</p><p></p><p>Role Type: Contractor</p><p></p><p>Location: Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Dutch Audio Recording Experts to contribute their advanced skills to a dynamic customer project. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters. We seek professionals with a strong background in recording professional-grade audio, preferably with experience delivering content for linguistics, voice technology, or media production purposes. This opportunity is ideal for native Dutch speakers who take pride in the precision, clarity, and authenticity of their delivered recordings and who thrive in remote, results-driven project environments.</p><p></p><p>Scope of Work</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Record high-quality Dutch audio samples using professional-grade equipment, adhering to specified guidelines and standards.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Deliver clear, authentic voice recordings across a range of prompts and scenarios to ensure coverage of diverse linguistic data.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Participate in a sample submission process, providing an audio sample that demonstrates your expertise and equipment capabilities.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Collaborate closely via written and verbal communication to clarify requirements and implement feedback on recordings.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ensure all deliverables meet project specifications for clarity, accuracy, and format.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Document recording processes and provide insight into best practices for capturing natural, high-fidelity Dutch speech.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Engage with the project team to resolve queries and contribute subject-matter knowledge where needed.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Preferred Qualifications</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Native-level proficiency in Dutch, with an authentic accent and excellent fluency.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>At least three years of hands-on experience in professional audio recording, preferably in voice, broadcast, or content production domains.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrable access to and expertise in using professional audio recording equipment (e.g., studio microphones, soundproofing, audio editing tools).</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Strong attention to detail and a commitment to producing accurate, high-quality recordings.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ability to communicate clearly and efficiently in both written and spoken forms.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Experience working on remote projects or in distributed teams, maintaining accountability and timely delivery of audio assets.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Familiarity with best practices in audio file management, labeling, and secure digital transfer.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Please note that you will need your professional audio equipment during the interview.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785648967,"expiryDate":1788240936,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/dutch-audio-recording-experts","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/dutch-audio-recording-experts"},{"title":"Physics Expert (Biophysics / Statistical Physics)","excerpt":"Role Title: Physics Expert (Biophysics / Statistical Physics) Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (Biophysics / Statistical Physics) to contribute to a research-level project focused on modeling bacterial population growth, stochastic two-state growth-rate switching, cell-size regulation noise, and asymptotic population growth rate.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Physics-Specialist","Biophysics-Researcher","Research-Physics-Expert","Physics-Expert","Physics-Consultant","Biopharmaceutical-Physicist","Physics-Research-Consultant"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p><strong>Role Title:</strong> Physics Expert (Biophysics / Statistical Physics)</p><p></p><p><strong>Role Type: </strong>Contractor</p><p><strong>Location:</strong> Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (Biophysics / Statistical Physics) to contribute to a research-level project focused on modeling bacterial population growth, stochastic two-state growth-rate switching, cell-size regulation noise, and asymptotic population growth rate. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input.</p><p></p><p>No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters. Participants may be considered for one or more assignments, including Solver, Auditor, or Adjudicator, based on subfield specialization, seniority, and hands-on experience with the relevant methods.</p><p></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Analyze and model stochastic two-state Markov processes with gamma-distributed waiting times in the context of bacterial population dynamics.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Apply the Euler-Lotka equation to assess and benchmark asymptotic population growth rates under varying noise regimes.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Develop or review analytical approaches using perturbative expansions in small division-noise variance and validate resulting predictions.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Integrate renewal theory and first-passage-time analysis to derive key insights on population growth and cell-size regulation noise.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Document detailed methodological steps, assumptions, and findings clearly for AI training and reproducibility purposes.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Advanced expertise in statistical physics, biophysics, or related quantitative biological modeling of stochastic processes.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Proven experience working with two-state Markov models and gamma-distributed waiting times in biological or physical systems.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Strong command of the Euler-Lotka equation, perturbative expansions, and renewal theory in the context of population or growth dynamics.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated ability to conduct first-passage-time analysis and interpret implications for growth-rate fluctuations and size control.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p><br></p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785648653,"expiryDate":1788240623,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-biophysics-statistical-physics","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-biophysics-statistical-physics"},{"title":"Physics Expert (High Energy / Mathematical Physics)","excerpt":"Role Title: Physics Expert (High Energy / Mathematical Physics) Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (High Energy / Mathematical Physics) to contribute their advanced subject-matter knowledge to a frontier customer project in theoretical physics.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Physics-Expert","Physics-Specialist","Physics-Research-Specialist","Senior-Research-Physicist","Physics-Subject-Matter-Expert","Research-Physicist"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p>Role Title: Physics Expert (High Energy / Mathematical Physics)</p><p></p><p><strong>Role Type: </strong>Contractor</p><p><strong>Location:</strong> Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (High Energy / Mathematical Physics) to contribute their advanced subject-matter knowledge to a frontier customer project in theoretical physics. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input.</p><p></p><p>No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters. This engagement centers on the latest research in Holography, AdS/CFT, and Weyl anomalies in dimensions d ≤ 8. Participants may be considered for one or more distinct assignments: Solver, Auditor, or Adjudicator, depending on subfield fit and proven hands-on experience.</p><p></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Analyze research-level problems involving AdS/CFT correspondence, on-shell gravitational actions, and Weyl-Fefferman-Graham gauge frameworks.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Formulate or verify complex tensor algebra expressions, particularly those involving boundary curvature invariants in dimensions up to 8.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Develop, review, or adjudicate solutions related to holographic Weyl anomalies and related benchmarks in mathematical physics.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Advanced expertise in high energy or mathematical physics, with direct experience in AdS/CFT, gravitational actions, and holographic dualities.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Extensive familiarity with Weyl anomalies, Fefferman-Graham expansion, and higher-dimensional boundary curvature invariants.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Strong command of tensor algebra, differential geometry, and the technical machinery relevant to holographic methods.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated ability to communicate complex scientific ideas effectively in both written and verbal formats.</p></li>\n</ol><p><br></p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785648504,"expiryDate":1788240466,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-high-energy-mathematical-physics-5946815961","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-high-energy-mathematical-physics-5946815961"},{"title":"Kiembu Bilingual Expert","excerpt":"Role Title: Kiembu Bilingual Expert Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Kiembu Bilingual Experts to participate in a dynamic language project for a valued customer.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Bilingual-Specialist","Bilingual-Translator","Bilingual-Professional","Bilingual-Communication-Specialist"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p>Role Title: Kiembu Bilingual Expert</p><p></p><p>Role Type: Contractor</p><p></p><p>Location: Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Kiembu Bilingual Experts to participate in a dynamic language project for a valued customer. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Transcribe video and audio materials in Kiembu, clearly outlining precise timestamps for each segment.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Provide detailed analysis of speaker emotions and tone across multimedia content.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Evaluate and annotate grammar usage, sentence construction, and overall linguistic features in Kiembu communication.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Define and explain conceptual meanings and cultural nuances of selected Kiembu words and phrases.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Participate in complex language tasks, including contextual analysis and high-level translation or interpretation undertakings.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Deliver clear, concise written and verbal feedback to support the project’s linguistic objectives.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ensure all deliverables meet specified quality standards and project guidelines.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Exceptional bilingual fluency in Kiembu and English, with advanced written and verbal communication skills.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>In-depth understanding of Kiembu grammar, syntax, and cultural context.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Experience in transcription, linguistic annotation, or related language-based projects.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Strong analytical capabilities to assess emotion, tone, and speaker intent.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Meticulous attention to detail and a commitment to high-quality, accurate deliverables.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Ability to work independently and consistently on intricate language tasks.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Background or interest in linguistics, translation, or language technology is a plus.</p></li>\n</ol><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785647976,"expiryDate":1788239745,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/kiembu-bilingual-expert","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/kiembu-bilingual-expert"},{"title":"Physics Expert (Condensed Matter / Quantum Information)","excerpt":"Role Title: Physics Expert (Condensed Matter / Quantum Information) Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (Condensed Matter / Quantum Information) to contribute to a frontier research-level physics benchmark project focused on topics such as the PXP model, Rydberg blockade, quantum many-body scars, and constrained dynamics.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Condensed-Matter-Physicist","Physics-Expert","Physics-Subject-Matter-Expert"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p><strong>Role Title: </strong>Physics Expert (Condensed Matter / Quantum Information)</p><p></p><p><strong>Role Type:</strong> Contractor</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (Condensed Matter / Quantum Information) to contribute to a frontier research-level physics benchmark project focused on topics such as the PXP model, Rydberg blockade, quantum many-body scars, and constrained dynamics. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Develop and analyze exact diagonalization implementations leveraging translation and reflection symmetries, with a preference for QuSpin and system sizes L ≥ 26.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Construct and manipulate block-diagonalized subspaces for complex quantum systems, optimizing computational efficiency and fidelity.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Evaluate overlaps with Z2 states and interpret resulting physical insights in the context of constrained quantum dynamics.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Contribute detailed written feedback, analytic reports, and assessments for research benchmarks related to quantum many-body scars and Rydberg blockade phenomena.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Serve as a Solver, Auditor, or Adjudicator on the project, depending on subfield alignment, hands-on methods expertise, and seniority.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Advanced academic background (PhD or equivalent practical experience) in condensed matter physics, quantum information, or a closely related field.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Proven expertise in exact diagonalization techniques, including experience with QuSpin and symmetries for large system sizes.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated ability to perform block-diagonalization of Hamiltonians and work within large Hilbert space subspaces.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Strong understanding of quantum many-body scars, Rydberg blockade, and constrained quantum dynamics.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Experience analyzing overlaps with Z2 or related quantum states, including the interpretation of numerical results.</p></li>\n</ol><p><br></p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785647851,"expiryDate":1788239521,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-condensed-matter-quantum-information","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-condensed-matter-quantum-information"},{"title":"BigLaw lawyers","excerpt":"Role Title: BigLaw lawyers Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging lawyers to contribute their subject-matter expertise in support of a customer's project.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":["United States"],"timezoneRestrictions":[-10,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,14],"categories":["Large-Law-Services","Law-Firms","Lawyer","Corporate-Lawyer","Senior-Lawyer","Corporate-Attorney","Law-Firm-Partner"],"parentCategories":["Legal"],"description":"<p>Role Title: BigLaw lawyers</p><p>Role Type: Contractor</p><p></p><p>Location: Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging lawyers to contribute their subject-matter expertise in support of a customer's project. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p>This opportunity is tailored for <strong>US-based legal professionals with mandatory experience working at one or more Vault Law 100 firms</strong>. Experience at a Vault Law 100 firm is a required qualification for this role, as we're seeking candidates with top-tier legal training and exposure to sophisticated, high-stakes legal matters who are interested in applying their expertise in a collaborative, technology-driven environment.</p><p></p><p>Scope of Work</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Conduct comprehensive legal analysis on a variety of US law topics, providing nuanced insights and guidance.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Perform in-depth legal research to support project objectives and ensure current, accurate information is utilized.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Draft, review, and edit legal content, including memoranda, opinions, contracts, and other relevant documents.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Assess and provide structured feedback on legal texts for clarity, accuracy, and alignment with best practices.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Participate in remote, multidisciplinary collaboration to refine project deliverables and address complex legal scenarios.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Contribute to content quality assurance by spotting errors, inconsistencies, or ambiguities in legal materials.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Apply meticulous attention to detail to maintain exceptionally high standards in all submissions.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p>Preferred Qualifications</p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Active license to practice law in the United States with strong academic credentials.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Experience in top Law Firms.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Current or prior experience at a top-tier US law firm, with exposure to varied practice areas.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Proven abilities in legal analysis, research, and drafting across a range of legal subjects.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Exceptional written and verbal communication skills, with demonstrated experience in legal content review.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Track record of successful remote collaboration and participation in multidisciplinary projects.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Experience with quality assurance and rubric-based evaluation of legal documents is a plus.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated commitment to precision, accuracy, and upholding legal best practices in all work.</p></li>\n</ol><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785647845,"expiryDate":1788239556,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/biglaw-lawyers","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/biglaw-lawyers"},{"title":"Strategy & Operations Associate","excerpt":"About A1There are over 5 billion users using basic applications today such email, notes, tasks that are not AI-native.","companyName":"Bjak","companySlug":"bjak","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/8ub8wtihrfrm3vfivlkcojai4np3","employmentType":"Full Time","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Entry-level","Mid-level"],"currency":null,"locationRestrictions":["United States"],"timezoneRestrictions":[-10,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,14],"categories":["Strategic-Operations-Associate","Strategy-and-Operations-Analyst","Strategy-Associate","Operations-Associate","Business-Strategy-Associate","Strategic-Planning-Associate"],"parentCategories":["Operations"],"description":"<h3>About A1</h3><p>There are over 5 billion users using basic applications today such email, notes, tasks that are not AI-native. Our mission is to build a proactive smart assistant for everyday users to bring intelligence to conversations, errands, organising and workflows, with minimal prompting.</p><p>Our product focuses on achieving high reliability for long-running workflows, persistent context, and real-world task completion. The system must handle multi-step reasoning, interact with external tools, and remain reliable despite non-deterministic model behavior. Our objective is to help users complete tasks daily enjoyable with over ~90%* reduced time.</p><h3>About the Role</h3><p>You will work closely with core teams on the highest impact initiatives across engineering, product, hiring, operations, and business development. As the company grows, you'll help solve new challenges, build new capabilities, and drive execution wherever it matters most.</p><p>We're looking for people who learn quickly, think deeply, and enjoy solving difficult problems in a fast-moving environment.</p><h3>What You Will Be Doing</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Drive high-priority initiatives across the business.</p></li>\n<li><p>Work with leadership to solve business and product challenges.</p></li>\n<li><p>Build new teams, processes, and capabilities as the company grows.</p></li>\n<li><p>Lead cross-functional projects from planning through execution.</p></li>\n<li><p>Research new markets, products, and business opportunities.</p></li>\n<li><p>Improve how we operate by identifying problems and implementing practical solutions.</p></li>\n<li><p>Take ownership of projects and deliver meaningful business outcomes.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>What You Will Need</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Strong problem-solving skills and business judgment.</p></li>\n<li><p>Ability to learn quickly and adapt to new challenges.</p></li>\n<li><p>Comfortable working across different business functions.</p></li>\n<li><h3>Strong ownership and execution skills.</h3></li>\n<li><p>Excellent communication and stakeholder management skills.</p></li>\n<li><p>Able to manage multiple priorities in a fast-moving environment.</p></li>\n<li><p>Curious, resourceful, and driven to build.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>How We Work</h3><p>The best products in the world are built by small, highly capable teams.</p><p>We operate with high talent density, high ownership and high standards. We value people who can think independently, move quickly and solve problems without waiting for instructions.</p><p>This is a hands-on environment. Everyone is expected to contribute directly to the company's success.</p><h3>Interview Process</h3><p>If there appears to be a fit, we will schedule up to 3 interviews.</p><p>Applications are reviewed by members of our leadership and hiring teams. Interviews may be conducted virtually or onsite.</p><p>We value speed, transparency and decisiveness throughout the process.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785647843,"expiryDate":1790831843,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/bjak/jobs/strategy-operations-associate-7652220692","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/bjak/jobs/strategy-operations-associate-7652220692"},{"title":"Physics Expert (AMO / Quantum Information)","excerpt":"Role Title: Physics Expert (AMO / Quantum Information) Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (AMO / Quantum Information) to contribute to a cutting-edge research-focused project in collaboration with a customer.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Quantum-Physics-Specialist","Quantum-Mechanics-Expert","Quantum-Computing-Specialist","Physics-Expert","Research-Physics-Expert","Quantum-Physicist"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p><strong>Role Title: </strong>Physics Expert (AMO / Quantum Information)</p><p></p><p><strong>Role Type:</strong> Contractor</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (AMO / Quantum Information) to contribute to a cutting-edge research-focused project in collaboration with a customer. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p></p><p>This opportunity centers on benchmarking advanced concepts in quantum optics, focusing on cascaded optical parametric amplifiers, SU(1,1) interferometers, and the effects of loss and two-mode squeezing. Contributors may participate as Solvers, Auditors, or Adjudicators, with assignments tailored to subfield specialization, experience, and demonstrated hands-on ability using the specified methods.</p><p></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Analyze and model cascaded optical parametric amplifiers and SU(1,1) interferometric systems under realistic loss mechanisms.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Apply Bogoliubov transformations and covariance-matrix techniques to quantify quantum correlations and noise properties.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Derive and interpret sideband photocurrent spectra utilizing homodyne detection methodologies.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Implement and critique loss modeling via fictitious beamsplitters, ensuring robust benchmarking against theoretical and experimental scenarios.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Utilize squeeze-parameter hyperbolic identities to characterize entanglement and squeezing performance in lossy quantum systems.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Advanced degree (PhD or equivalent experience) in Atomic, Molecular, and Optical (AMO) Physics, Quantum Optics, or Quantum Information Science.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Proven expertise with Bogoliubov transformations, covariance-matrix formalism, and quantum noise analysis.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Hands-on familiarity with sideband spectra, homodyne detection, and modeling of quantum optical loss mechanisms.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated ability applying squeeze-parameter hyperbolic identities in practical research or experimental analysis.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Familiarity with frontier research involving cascaded parametric amplifiers, SU(1,1) interferometry, or two-mode squeezing is highly valued.</p></li>\n</ol><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785647839,"expiryDate":1788239315,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-amo-quantum-information","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-amo-quantum-information"},{"title":"Founding Full-Stack iOS Engineer","excerpt":"About the RoleThis is a founding engineering opportunity at a Y Combinator–backed consumer wearable startup operating at the intersection of biometrics, emotional intelligence, and mobile software.","companyName":"Clera","companySlug":"clera","companyLogo":"","employmentType":"Full Time","minSalary":150000,"maxSalary":150000,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Executive"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":["United Kingdom","United States"],"timezoneRestrictions":[-10,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,0,14],"categories":["Founding-Fullstack-Engineer","Founding-Software-Engineer","IOS-Engineer","IOS-Software-Engineer","Founding-CTO"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<h3>About the Role</h3><p>This is a founding engineering opportunity at a Y Combinator–backed consumer wearable startup operating at the intersection of biometrics, emotional intelligence, and mobile software. The company is building a wearable device that reads emotional states in real time — think of it as a fitness tracker, but for your EQ — powered by a proprietary computational neuroscience inference model processing over 150 audio and biometric signals.</p><p>As the <strong>Founding Full-Stack iOS Engineer</strong>, you will own the companion iOS app end-to-end. This is a high-ownership, high-impact role: you'll be one of the first engineers at the company, expected to grow into a leadership position as the team scales. Prototypes are already on users' wrists — this is a real product with real momentum.</p><h3>What You'll Do</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Own the companion iOS app end-to-end, from architecture decisions to pixel-perfect UI delivery</p></li>\n<li><p>Surface emotional-state outputs (energy, mood, focus scores) from the backend inference model in a clear, compelling, and polished consumer experience</p></li>\n<li><p>Collaborate closely with the founding team — including hardware, neuroscience, and design — to shape the full product experience</p></li>\n<li><p>Build and maintain full-stack integrations between the iOS app and backend services</p></li>\n<li><p>Set engineering standards and best practices as the mobile org grows around you</p></li>\n</ul><h3>What We're Looking For</h3><h3>Required</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Several years of professional experience shipping consumer-grade iOS apps (no fresh graduates)</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong proficiency in <strong>Swift</strong> and the iOS ecosystem</p></li>\n<li><p>Full-stack capability — comfortable working across mobile and backend layers</p></li>\n<li><p>Track record of owning and delivering polished, production-quality mobile products</p></li>\n<li><p>Self-directed and comfortable working in a fast-moving, early-stage environment</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Nice to Have</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Experience with health, fitness, or wearable consumer apps</p></li>\n<li><p>Familiarity with biometric data, Bluetooth/BLE hardware integration, or real-time data streaming</p></li>\n<li><p>Prior founding or very early-stage startup experience</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Compensation &amp; Benefits</h3><ul>\n<li><p><strong>Salary:</strong> ~$150,000 USD (or ~£75,000 GBP for London-based candidates)</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Equity:</strong> Up to 1–2% — meaningful founding-level ownership</p></li>\n<li><p>Early-stage company with Series A/B angel and strategic-partner funding round in progress</p></li>\n<li><p><strong>Visa sponsorship:</strong> Not available for new sponsorships; visa transfers are welcome</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Location</h3><p>Primary office in <strong>London, United Kingdom</strong>. The team is also present in San Francisco. Flexible arrangements considered for the right candidate — on-site or remote.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785647820,"expiryDate":1790831820,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/clera/jobs/founding-full-stack-ios-engineer","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/clera/jobs/founding-full-stack-ios-engineer"},{"title":"Founding Full Stack Engineer","excerpt":"About the RoleThis is a founding engineering role at an early-stage healthtech SaaS company building the system of record for nursing excellence.","companyName":"Clera","companySlug":"clera","companyLogo":"","employmentType":"Full Time","minSalary":135000,"maxSalary":155000,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Executive"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":["United States"],"timezoneRestrictions":[-10,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,14],"categories":["Founding-Fullstack-Engineer","Founding-Software-Engineer","Principal-Full-Stack-Engineer","Full-Stack-Engineer","Founding-Engineer","Technical-Founding-Engineer","Lead-Full-Stack-Engineer","Principal-Fullstack-Software-Engineer"],"parentCategories":["Developer"],"description":"<h3>About the Role</h3><p>This is a founding engineering role at an early-stage healthtech SaaS company building the system of record for nursing excellence. The platform helps large health systems improve nurse retention and patient outcomes by centralizing professional governance, digital clinical ladder programs, clinical inquiry (EBP, QI, Research), and ANCC designation management — replacing fragmented spreadsheets and shared drives with a unified, enterprise-grade product.</p><p>You'll be the first or among the first engineers, working directly with the founding team to own architecture, set standards, and ship production features across four integrated products. This is a high-ownership, high-impact role in a massive and underserved healthcare vertical.</p><p><strong>No visa sponsorship is available.</strong> Candidates must be authorized to work in the United States without company sponsorship.</p><h3>What You'll Do</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Own end-to-end architecture and ship production features across a suite of four integrated SaaS products</p></li>\n<li><p>Design data models and backend services for complex multi-hospital, multi-unit organizational structures</p></li>\n<li><p>Build AI workflows for exemplar writing, evidence organization, and document retrieval across large program datasets</p></li>\n<li><p>Implement enterprise infrastructure including SSO/SAML, role-based access control (RBAC), audit logging, and HRIS integrations</p></li>\n<li><p>Join customer calls, hear problems firsthand, and translate feedback into shipped product within tight timelines</p></li>\n<li><p>Define and establish engineering standards, CI/CD pipelines, testing strategies, and scalable architectural patterns for a growing team</p></li>\n</ul><h3>What We're Looking For</h3><h3>Required:</h3><ul>\n<li><p>5+ years of experience building production SaaS products</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong full-stack development skills: <strong>TypeScript, React, and server-side JavaScript (Node.js)</strong></p></li>\n<li><p>Experience designing backend systems for multi-tenant or multi-unit, workflow-heavy applications</p></li>\n<li><p>Hands-on experience with enterprise authentication (SSO/SAML), RBAC, audit logging, and HRIS integration</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience building AI-powered workflows for document generation, evidence organization, or large-dataset retrieval</p></li>\n<li><p>Proven ability to own both architecture and implementation in an early-stage, fast-moving environment</p></li>\n<li><p>Ability to engage directly with non-technical domain experts and customers, and translate feedback quickly into product</p></li>\n<li><p>Clear written and verbal communicator who collaborates well across functions</p></li>\n</ul><p><strong>Tech stack in use:</strong> Next.js, React, TypeScript, PostgreSQL, Supabase, Vercel, AWS S3</p><h3>Compensation &amp; Benefits</h3><ul>\n<li><p><strong>Salary:</strong> $135,000 – $155,000 USD annually</p></li>\n<li><p>Equity and stock options with clear career progression</p></li>\n<li><h3>401(k) with company match</h3></li>\n<li><p>Learning &amp; development stipend (tuition, certifications, conferences)</p></li>\n<li><p>Comprehensive wellness program and mental health resources</p></li>\n<li><p>Generous paid parental leave (including adoption and surrogacy)</p></li>\n<li><p>Commuter benefits and Employee Assistance Program (EAP)</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Location</h3><p>This role is <strong>fully remote (US-based)</strong>. The company is headquartered in <strong>San Francisco, CA</strong>.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785647683,"expiryDate":1790831682,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/clera/jobs/founding-full-stack-engineer","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/clera/jobs/founding-full-stack-engineer"},{"title":"Senior Machine Learning Engineer","excerpt":"About A1There are over 5 billion users using basic applications today such email, notes, tasks that are not AI-native.","companyName":"Bjak","companySlug":"bjak","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/8ub8wtihrfrm3vfivlkcojai4np3","employmentType":"Full Time","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Senior"],"currency":null,"locationRestrictions":["United States"],"timezoneRestrictions":[-10,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,14],"categories":["Senior-ML-Engineer","Senior-Staff-Machine-Learning-Engineer","Senior-AI-ML-Engineer","Sr.-Staff-Machine-Learning-Engineer","Senior-Machine-Learning-Engineering-Manager","Lead-Machine-Learning-Engineer"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<h3><strong>About A1</strong></h3><p>There are over 5 billion users using basic applications today such email, notes, tasks that are not AI-native. Our mission is to build a proactive smart assistant for everyday users to bring intelligence to conversations, errands, organising and workflows, with minimal prompting.</p><p>Our product focuses on achieving high reliability for long-running workflows, persistent context, and real-world task completion. The system must handle multi-step reasoning, interact with external tools, and remain reliable despite non-deterministic model behavior. Our objective is to help users complete tasks daily enjoyable with over ~90%* reduced time.</p><h3>Role</h3><p>As a Senior Member of Technical Staff, Machine Learning, you are an independent owner of critical ML subsystems in production. You take ambiguous problems, design practical solutions, and ship systems that operate reliably at scale.</p><p>This is a hands-on, high-impact role focused on depth.</p><h3><strong>Focus</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p>Build core ML systems that power a proactive, long-horizon AI product.</p></li>\n<li><p>Own work end-to-end: data preparation, training, evaluation, inference, and iteration.</p></li>\n<li><p>Turn research ideas into working systems that run reliably in production.</p></li>\n<li><p>Debug model failures and system issues using real production signals.</p></li>\n<li><p>Iterate quickly: ship, measure outcomes, refine, and repeat.</p></li>\n<li><p>Collaborate closely with research, product, and engineering to deliver real user impact.</p></li>\n<li><p>Mentor and review work from other ML engineers through example and technical judgment.</p></li>\n<li><p>Work under real production constraints: latency, cost, reliability, and safety</p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Tech Stack</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><h3>Python</h3></li>\n<li><h3>PyTorch / JAX</h3></li>\n<li><h3>GPU-based training and inference systems</h3></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Ideal Experience</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p>You have built and shipped ML systems used by real users.</p></li>\n<li><p>You understand how modern ML models behave — and misbehave — in production.</p></li>\n<li><p>You write strong, production-quality code and think in systems, not scripts.</p></li>\n<li><p>You take ownership, work independently, and push work across the finish line.</p></li>\n<li><p>You learn fast, communicate clearly, and improve through iteration.</p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>Outcomes</strong></h3><ul>\n<li><p>ML models and systems in production consistently meet accuracy, latency, reliability, and efficiency targets.</p></li>\n<li><p>Complex production issues are monitored, debugged, and resolved with minimal disruption.</p></li>\n<li><p>Training, inference, and data pipelines are robust, scalable, and maintainable over time.</p></li>\n<li><p>Drives measurable improvements in ML systems based on real-world signals and user feedback.</p></li>\n<li><p>Provides mentorship and technical guidance to peers, raising the overall ML engineering standard.</p></li>\n<li><p>Collaborates cross-functionally to ensure ML features integrate seamlessly into products and meet business goals.</p></li>\n</ul><h3><strong>How We Work</strong></h3><p>The best products today in the world were built by small, world class teams. We are a high talent density and hands-on team. We make decisions collectively, move at rapid speed, striking a balance between shipping high quality work and learning.  Joining our team requires the ability to bring structure, exercise judgment, and execute independently. Our goal is to put in hands of our users a truly magical product</p><h3><strong>Interview process</strong></h3><p>If there appears to be a fit, we'll reach to schedule 3, but no more than 4 interviews.</p><p>Applications are evaluated by our technical team members. Interviews will be conducted via virtual meetings and/or onsite.</p><p>We value transparency and efficiency, so expect a prompt decision. If you've demonstrated the exceptional skills and mindset we're looking for, we'll extend an offer to join us. This isn't just a job offer; it's an invitation to be part of a team that's bringing AI to have practical benefits to billions globally.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785647157,"expiryDate":1790831156,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/bjak/jobs/senior-machine-learning-engineer-851744356","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/bjak/jobs/senior-machine-learning-engineer-851744356"},{"title":"Physics Expert (Statistical Physics / Quantum Information / Condensed Matter)","excerpt":"Role Title: Physics Expert (Statistical Physics / Quantum Information / Condensed Matter) Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (Statistical Physics / Quantum Information / Condensed Matter) to contribute to a research-driven customer project at the intersection of theoretical physics and numerical benchmarking.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Physics-Expert","Quantum-Physics-Specialist","Quantum-Mechanics-Expert","Physics-Specialist","Physics-Research-Specialist"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p><strong>Role Title: </strong>Physics Expert (Statistical Physics / Quantum Information / Condensed Matter)</p><p></p><p><strong>Role Type:</strong> Contractor</p><p><strong>Location: </strong>Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (Statistical Physics / Quantum Information / Condensed Matter) to contribute to a research-driven customer project at the intersection of theoretical physics and numerical benchmarking.</p><p></p><p>In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Analyze and provide expert insights into complex statistical physics phenomena, with a focus on replicated random-bond Ising/Ashkin-Teller models, the toric-code threshold, and the Nishimori line.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Deliver clear, well-documented solutions or critiques of problems relating to Kramers-Wannier duality, quenched disorder averaging, square-lattice self-duality, and domain-wall free energy.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Engage in advanced numerical work, particularly around 4-state Potts model simulations and interpretation.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Identify, discuss, and resolve technical challenges involving noncontractible loop defects and related topological features.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Participate as a Solver, Auditor, or Adjudicator on specific project assignments based on your experience and subfield strengths.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Advanced academic background (PhD or equivalent experience) in physics, with specialization in statistical physics, quantum information, or condensed matter theory.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Direct, hands-on experience applying Kramers-Wannier duality, quenched disorder averaging, and square-lattice self-duality in research or project settings.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated proficiency in numerical simulations involving the 4-state Potts model and analysis of domain-wall free energy.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Familiarity with topological quantum codes, particularly the toric code and its threshold phenomena.</p></li>\n</ol><p><br></p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785647072,"expiryDate":1788239035,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-statistical-physics-quantum-information-condensed-matter","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-statistical-physics-quantum-information-condensed-matter"},{"title":"Founding Member of Technical Staff","excerpt":"About the RoleThis is a founding engineering role at an early-stage healthtech / safety-critical AI startup building evidence infrastructure for AI model validation in medical diagnostics.","companyName":"Clera","companySlug":"clera","companyLogo":"","employmentType":"Full Time","minSalary":150000,"maxSalary":200000,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Executive"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":["United States"],"timezoneRestrictions":[-10,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,14],"categories":["Founding-Team-Member","Founding-Engineer","Technical-Founder","Founding-CTO"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<h3>About the Role</h3><p>This is a founding engineering role at an early-stage <strong>healthtech / safety-critical AI</strong> startup building evidence infrastructure for AI model validation in medical diagnostics. As a Founding Member of Technical Staff, you will help shape the core reasoning methodology that underpins how AI safety claims are investigated, structured, and validated — across the full product lifecycle. You'll work directly alongside the founding team, contributing across technical domains and helping lay the infrastructure for the future of safety-critical AI.</p><h3>What You'll Do</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Design and execute investigations into how AI models perform and fail across real-world scenarios.</p></li>\n<li><p>Analyze input data, model outputs, and internal representations to evaluate data quality, generalization limits, distribution shift, subgroup performance, and demographic bias.</p></li>\n<li><p>Surface failure modes and produce structured evidence that supports, challenges, or refines claims about model performance and safety.</p></li>\n<li><p>Develop and evolve the company's evidence methodology — defining how claims, arguments, and evidence should be structured for rigorous AI validation.</p></li>\n<li><p>Pressure-test assumptions, critique weak argument structures, and systematize repeated investigations into reusable methods, workflows, and platform primitives.</p></li>\n<li><p>Write production-quality Python, build agentic workflows for evidence investigation, and prototype front-end features using AI tooling.</p></li>\n<li><p>Contribute beyond your immediate technical domain — this is a founding role that requires ownership, versatility, and the willingness to challenge assumptions.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>What We're Looking For</h3><h3>Required:</h3><ul>\n<li><p>Degree in CS, mathematics, physics, engineering, or a related quantitative field — or equivalent demonstrated depth.</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong ML, statistics, and data science fundamentals; ability to understand the math behind methods, identify broken assumptions, and reason about trade-offs.</p></li>\n<li><p>Expert Python skills, spanning raw data analysis through to platform-level code others will rely on.</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong engineering judgment on code structure, interface boundaries, and reusability trade-offs.</p></li>\n<li><p>Demonstrated ability to operate as a founding-team-caliber contributor — taking end-to-end ownership and contributing across domains.</p></li>\n<li><p>Strong cross-functional communication skills; able to present evidence, claims, and validation results to both technical and non-technical stakeholders.</p></li>\n<li><p>Comfort using AI tooling as a primary mode of working.</p></li>\n<li><p>Authorized to work in the United States without visa sponsorship; able to work on-site in Sunnyvale, CA.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Nice to Have:</h3><ul>\n<li><p>3–5 years of professional ML experience, or a PhD in model evaluation, robustness, out-of-distribution detection, interpretability, or a related area.</p></li>\n<li><p>Experience with AI/ML medical device submissions, FDA review processes, or other regulated environments (e.g., FDA 510(k), De Novo, EU AI Act).</p></li>\n<li><p>Background in safety case methodology in aviation, automotive, healthcare, or other safety-critical fields.</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Compensation &amp; Benefits</h3><ul>\n<li><p><strong>Salary:</strong> $150,000 – $200,000 USD annually</p></li>\n<li><p>Founding team equity and early-stage upside</p></li>\n</ul><h3>Location</h3><p>On-site in <strong>Sunnyvale, CA, United States</strong>. This is a full-time, in-office role. Visa sponsorship is <strong>not available</strong> — candidates must be authorized to work in the US without sponsorship.</p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785646833,"expiryDate":1790830832,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/clera/jobs/founding-member-of-technical-staff","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/clera/jobs/founding-member-of-technical-staff"},{"title":"Physics Expert (Gravitation / Cosmology / Astrophysics)","excerpt":"Role Title: Physics Expert (Gravitation / Cosmology / Astrophysics) Role Type: Contractor Location: Remote micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (Gravitation / Cosmology / Astrophysics) to participate in an advanced, research-driven project for a valued customer.","companyName":"micro1","companySlug":"micro1","companyLogo":"https://cdn-images.himalayas.app/91oa56akgt3qjqc1nh3uoruub40c","employmentType":"Contractor","minSalary":null,"maxSalary":null,"salaryPeriod":"annual","seniority":["Mid-level"],"currency":"USD","locationRestrictions":[],"timezoneRestrictions":[-11,-10,-9.5,-9,-8,-7,-6,-5,-4,-3.5,-3,-2,-1,0,1,2,3,3.5,4,4.5,5,5.5,5.75,6,6.5,7,8,8.75,9,9.5,10,10.5,11,12,12.75,13,14],"categories":["Physics-Expert","Research-Physics-Expert","Cosmology-Expert","Astrophysics-Specialist","Physics-Research-Consultant"],"parentCategories":[],"description":"<p><strong>Role Title:</strong> Physics Expert (Gravitation / Cosmology / Astrophysics)</p><p></p><p><strong>Role Type:</strong> Contractor</p><p><strong>Location:</strong> Remote</p><p></p><p>micro1 is engaging Physics Experts (Gravitation / Cosmology / Astrophysics) to participate in an advanced, research-driven project for a valued customer. In this role, you'll apply your expertise to help train next-generation AI systems. Your work will shape how models learn, reason, and perform through high-quality, real-world input. No prior experience in AI is required — your domain knowledge is what matters.</p><p></p><p>This opportunity focuses on contributions to a frontier research-level physics benchmark spanning Dynamical Chern-Simons gravity, the Palatini tetrad formalism, FRW cosmology, quadratic inflation, and related phenomena. Based on your expertise, you may be considered for specialized assignments such as Solver, Auditor, or Adjudicator, with specific scopes and deliverables aligned to your subfield experience.</p><p></p><p><strong>Scope of Work</strong></p><p></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Provide detailed analytical and numerical solutions to problems involving Palatini gravity (first-order formalism), including tetrad and spin connection approaches.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Calculate and analyze Pontryagin density contributions and their implications in extended gravity theories.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Formulate, solve, and interpret Friedmann ODEs with torsion and their relevance in cosmological models.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Integrate coupled, nonlinear ODEs using advanced methods and critically evaluate results.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Apply Planck-unit normalization in all theoretical and computational tasks to ensure consistency and comparability.</p></li>\n</ol><p></p><p></p><p><strong>Preferred Qualifications</strong></p><p></p><ol class=\"list-decimal list-outside leading-3 -mt-2\">\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Advanced academic background (PhD or equivalent) in physics, with emphasis on gravitation, cosmology, or astrophysics.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Hands-on experience working with first-order Palatini gravity, tetrad and spin connection formalisms, and higher-order curvature corrections.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Proven ability to derive, solve, and interpret nonlinear ODE systems relevant to cosmology and gravitational physics.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Familiarity with Pontryagin density, Chern-Simons modifications, and their physical implications.</p></li>\n<li class=\"leading-normal -mb-2\"><p>Demonstrated experience with Planck-unit normalization and physical interpretation in theoretical models.</p></li>\n</ol><p><br></p><p>Originally posted on <a href=\"https://himalayas.app\">Himalayas</a></p>","pubDate":1785646807,"expiryDate":1788238770,"applicationLink":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-gravitation-cosmology-astrophysics","guid":"https://himalayas.app/companies/micro1/jobs/physics-expert-gravitation-cosmology-astrophysics"}]}